, ein Sternbild-Zeigespiel und ein konfigurierbares Planetarium wird Ihr Astronomielernen erneuert.", "short_description": "Virtual-Reality-Planetarium. Entdeckungsszenario, Quiz, Entdeckung von Sternbildern und interaktives Planetarium."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1566535108433352", "locale": "en_GB", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rvarium", "keywords": ["Planetarium", "Astronomy", "Stars", "Space", "Constellations"], "long_description": "Rediscover the stars in virtual reality thanks to Rvarium. Through interactive or non-interactive scenarios, dedicated quizzes, a constellation pointing game and a configurable planetarium, your learning of astronomy will be renewed.", "short_description": "Virtual reality planetarium. Discovery scenario, quizzes, constellation discovery and interactive planetarium."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1443308937699281", "locale": "zh_CN", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rvarium", "keywords": ["\u5929\u8c61\u4eea", "\u5929\u6587\u5b66", "\u661f\u661f", "\u592a\u7a7a", "\u661f\u5ea7"], "long_description": "\u501f\u52a9 Rvarium\uff0c\u5728\u865a\u62df\u73b0\u5b9e\u4e2d\u91cd\u65b0\u53d1\u73b0\u661f\u661f\u3002\u901a\u8fc7\u4e92\u52a8\u6216\u975e\u4e92\u52a8\u573a\u666f\u3001\u4e13\u5c5e\u95ee\u7b54\u3001\u661f\u5ea7\u6307\u5411\u6e38\u620f\u548c\u53ef\u914d\u7f6e\u7684\u5929\u8c61\u4eea\uff0c\u60a8\u7684\u5929\u6587\u5b66\u5b66\u4e60\u5c06\u7115\u7136\u4e00\u65b0\u3002", "short_description": "\u865a\u62df\u73b0\u5b9e\u5929\u8c61\u4eea\u3002\u63a2\u7d22\u573a\u666f\u3001\u95ee\u7b54\u3001\u661f\u5ea7\u53d1\u73b0\u548c\u4e92\u52a8\u5929\u8c61\u4eea\u3002"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1342343937989314", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Rvarium", "keywords": ["Planetario", "Astronom\u00eda", "Estrellas", "Espacio", "Constelacion